nd changes that contextualize it instead.\nHistory tasks need sufficient query-relevant evidence, not an exhaustive inventory\nof every past event, preference or experience. For open-ended background, ask for\na concise sourced text summary of relevant examples and changes. Use a set variable\nonly when its task explicitly defines a bounded whole set that can be established\nfrom the available history; a single witnessed member does not establish that whole.\nEvery nonterminal unrestricted text variable without a deterministic task expression\nMUST explicitly declare one of these evidence_semantics values:\n- \"personal_history_summary\": an open account of historical events, preferences,\n  experiences or changes that compatible evidence can extend. Declare this on each\n  such retrieval variable, not only on an optional later summary node. It is a\n  revisable sourced representation, not an exhaustive inventory or a unique scalar fact.\n- \"personal_atomic_fact\": one scoped atomic fact, such as a single name or date.\n  It keeps ordinary whole-value consistency and cannot use summary revision.\nDo not omit this choice or label multiple event examples or a preference trajectory\nas an atomic fact. The code will not infer a choice from the variable's name.\nNeither marker applies to numeric/rule variables, bounded domains, deterministic\ntask expressions or the final response. Each marked variable still needs its scope.\nFor an utterance such as \"I tried X\", do not make listing everything the user has\never tried a prerequisite. Retrieve the prior attitudes or experiences needed to\nunderstand X in context. A separate history-summary node is optional, not mandatory.\n\n\nFor a personalized query, relevant preferences, past experiences, dislikes,\nreasons, historical stages and constraints are evidence even when they do not repeat the new event.\nA recommendation needs evidence of the user's tastes; the history need not already contain the recommendation.\nA conversational update is not a request to discover unspecified event names, dates, locations or schedules.\nRequire these details only if actually requested. Adapt to the query: do not impose a change/reason template\non every question. Preserve uncertain cross-domain connections as implicit/partial, not explicit facts.\nDo not treat an assistant suggestion as a user preference or observation order as calendar event time.\nThis task is a personalized reply. Plan retrieval of relevant personal history, not a questionnaire for missing external facts. Keep independent history needs independent; do not block them on guessed names.\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"final_node_id\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"output_contract\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"entity_scope\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"explanation\": {\"enum\": [\"none\", \"one\", \"all\", \"semantic\"]}, \"fields\": {\"items\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"minItems\": 1, \"type\": \"array\", \"uniqueItems\": true}, \"mode\": {\"enum\": [\"value\", \"one_reason\", \"all_failures\", \"semantic\"]}, \"result_type\": {\"enum\": [\"bool\", \"entity\", \"number\", \"record\", \"set\", \"text\"]}, \"time_scope\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"mode\", \"result_type\", \"entity_scope\", \"time_scope\", \"explanation\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"program\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"constraints\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"object\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"expression\": {\"type\": \"object\"}, \"rule_binding\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"condition_demands\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"minItems\": 1, \"type\": \"array\", \"uniqueItems\": true}, \"variable\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"variable\", \"condition_demands\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"rules_complete\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"}, \"task_expressions\": {\"additionalProperties\": {\"type\": \"object\"}, \"type\": \"object\"}, \"variables\": {\"additionalProperties\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"demand\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"domain\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"items\": {}, \"type\": \"array\", \"uniqueItems\": true}, {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"lower\": {\"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"]}, \"lower_closed\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"}, \"unit\": {\"enum\": [null, \"cm\", \"h\", \"hours\", \"km\", \"m\", \"min\", \"minutes\", \"ms\", \"s\", \"seconds\"]}, \"upper\": {\"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"]}, \"upper_closed\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"}}, \"required\": [\"lower\", \"upper\"], \"type\": \"object\"}], \"description\": \"Optional legal domain; omit if unrestricted. Arrays list finite values; interval objects apply only to number variables.\"}, \"evidence_semantics\": {\"description\": \"Every nonterminal unrestricted text evidence variable without a deterministic task expression must explicitly choose: personal_history_summary for an open history account that compatible evidence can extend; personal_atomic_fact for one scoped atomic fact. Neither marker belongs to a bounded domain, rule, deterministic binding or final response.\", \"enum\": [\"personal_history_summary\", \"personal_atomic_fact\"]}, \"open\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"}, \"scope\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"entity_scope\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}, \"time_scope\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"entity_scope\", \"time_scope\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"type\": {\"enum\": [\"bool\", \"entity\", \"number\", \"text\", \"set\", \"record\", \"rule\"]}, \"unit\": {\"enum\": [null, \"cm\", \"h\", \"hours\", \"km\", \"m\", \"min\", \"minutes\", \"ms\", \"s\", \"seconds\"]}}, \"required\": [\"type\", \"demand\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"type\": \"object\"}}, \"required\": [\"variables\", \"expression\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"steps\": {\"items\