olumns\":[\"id\",\"doc_id\",\"start\",\"end\",\"text\",\"source_role\",\"source_message_indices\"],\"shared_history_texts\":{\"t0\":\"The user has a deep emotional connection to music but has struggled with technical and analytical approaches. They explored various genres and attended festivals (including an electronic music festival in 2017), but found music theory and historical research tedious and overwhelming (2018, 2020). They enjoy attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, creating mood-based playlists, and blending natural sounds with melody in their own compositions. They have created music incorporating field recordings from nature, which rejuvenated their passion. They have considered composing original music and collaborating with other musicians. They value personal, emotional engagement over passive consumption or technical dissection.\",\"t1\":\"The user has moved away from technical, analytical approaches to music (music theory, audio production, historical research) because they felt like chores and diminished joy. They now prefer emotionally connected, personal, and creative engagement: composing original tracks, exploring genres and cultural significance, attending live performances, discovering album artwork/lyrics/stories, and making mood-based playlists. They have also found fulfillment in creating music that connects with their heritage and personal identity.\",\"t2\":\"The user values personal fulfillment and creative expression through music that is emotionally connected, personally meaningful, and rooted in heritage, while avoiding overly technical or structured approaches that feel like a chore. They seek deeper engagement through exploring genres, cultural significance, live performances, album artwork and lyrics, making playlists, blending traditional roots with modern sounds, and developing an app to help others do the same. They prioritize joy, emotional connection, and self-discovery over analytical or passive consumption.\"},\"grounded_subquestion_parts\":[\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\\nEstablished music_history: \",{\"text_ref\":\"t0\"},\"\\nEstablished current_constraints: \",{\"text_ref\":\"t1\"},\"\\nEstablished goals_values: \",{\"text_ref\":\"t2\"}]}"
